        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 5_000_000\n    coupon_rate = 0.025\n    market_rate = 0.03\n    years = 3\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n    bond_value = sum(\n        annual_coupon / ((1 + market_rate) ** period)\n        for period in range(1, years + 1)\n    )\n    bond_value += face_value / ((1 + market_rate) ** years)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(bond_value, 3)\n```",
